bgaccent-data-homographs
========================

The homograph stress-rule data in this package (pos_rules.json) is derived from:

  - Bulgarian Wiktionary, obtained via kaikki.org machine-readable extracts.
    Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike (CC-BY-SA).
    https://www.wiktionary.org/  /  https://kaikki.org/

The (form, POS) -> stress-ordinal table was produced by aggregating attested
stress placements; it is distributed under CC-BY-SA-4.0 in accordance with the
share-alike terms of the source.

The packaging code in this distribution is part of the BGAccent project.
The BGAccent core engine itself is MIT-licensed and distributed separately as
the `bgaccent` package.
